stages.sampleAnswer:
GET /events?city&date → [Event]
GET /events/:id/seats → { sections: [{ id, seats: [{ id, status }] }] }
POST /events/:id/holds  body: { seatIds: [..] }, header: Idempotency-Key
  → 201 { holdId, expiresAt }  OR  409 if any seat unavailable
POST /holds/:holdId/purchase  body: { paymentToken }
  → 200 { bookingId }
DELETE /holds/:holdId → 204
